'''Empress' Excavation 2''' (女王の発掘調査２, ''Joō no Hakkutsu Chōsa 2'', '''Queen's Excavation 2''') is an [[Empress' Research]] map unlocked after clearing [[Empress' Excavation 1]]. Just like its predecessor, it has four stages and disappears for the rest of the day after clearing one, so it will take at least 4 days to clear the whole map. Each stage has a different one-time reward, including [[Ancient Egg: N003 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N003]] in stage 4. Once completed, the player will unlock [[Empress' Excavation 3]], which drops another [[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N004]]. It was added in [[Version 11.7 Update|Version 11.7]].

